1. PROJECT IDENTITY AND OBJECTIVE

You are working on an existing educational web application called Wara2ty (ورقتي) – Your Smart Study Assistant.

Official website:
https://wara2ty.ai.studio

Tagline:
Your lectures, organized. Your learning, smarter.

Arabic tagline:
محاضراتك في مكان واحد، ومذاكرتك بطريقة أذكى.

Wara2ty is an AI-powered educational assistant that transforms lecture images and study materials into organized, understandable, and interactive learning resources.

The main objective is to help students move from raw lecture materials to a complete study experience through one integrated application.

CRITICAL INSTRUCTION

This is an EXISTING PROJECT.

Do not create a new application from scratch.

Do not replace the existing architecture, rewrite the entire codebase, remove existing features, or change the core identity of the product.

First inspect and understand the existing codebase, components, application structure, current functionality, backend, API integration, and deployment configuration.

Then implement the requested improvements directly into the existing project.

Preserve all working functionality and improve the application incrementally.

The application must remain focused on analyzing uploaded lectures and helping students study those lectures. Do not transform it into a standalone language-learning platform, grammar course, or Duolingo-style application.

